{"id": "contrast_formula-7", "q": "contrast_formula", "yes": true, "text": "Turns out the issue had nothing to do with the model; retrieval was to blame.", "rule": "contrast/isnt-x-its-y", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "contrast_formula-8", "q": "contrast_formula", "yes": true, "text": "So it isn't really about the prompt. It's about the data.", "rule": "contrast/isnt-x-its-y", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
