{"id": "closer-105", "q": "closer", "yes": true, "text": "Most setups throw the context away after every task and start again. Ours stays.", "rule": "structure/gravitas-closer", "mode": "post", "orig": true}
{"id": "closer-106", "q": "closer", "yes": true, "text": "Every other setup throws the context away after each task. Ours keeps it. Always.", "rule": "structure/gravitas-closer", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "closer-107", "q": "closer", "yes": true, "text": "Other tools reset after each task and start from nothing. Not this one.", "rule": "structure/gravitas-closer", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "closer-108", "q": "closer", "yes": true, "text": "The agent reads the ticket, checks the order and writes the reply. That's the workflow.", "rule": "narrator/brand-closer", "mode": "post", "orig": true}
{"id": "closer-109", "q": "closer", "yes": true, "text": "The agent reads the ticket, checks the order and writes the reply. And that, right there, is the whole workflow.", "rule": "narrator/brand-closer", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "closer-110", "q": "closer", "yes": true, "text": "It reads, it checks, it replies. That is what we built.", "rule": "narrator/brand-closer", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "closer-111", "q": "closer", "yes": true, "text": "Say a customer writes in. You ask the model for a reply. It writes about the billing retries. It just doesn't ask itself.", "rule": "script/punchline-closer", "mode": "script", "orig": true}
{"id": "closer-112", "q": "closer", "yes": true, "text": "You ask the model for a reply and it writes about the billing retries. It simply never stops to ask.", "rule": "script/punchline-closer", "mode": "script", "orig": false}
{"id": "closer-113", "q": "closer", "yes": false, "text": "Other setups throw the context away after each task; ours keeps it, so the next task starts with what the last one learned.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "closer-114", "q": "closer", "yes": false, "text": "The agent reads the ticket, checks the order and writes the reply, and a person reviews it before it goes out.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
