{"id": "engagement_bait-128", "q": "engagement_bait", "yes": false, "text": "We'll publish the eval set next week.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "engagement_bait-129", "q": "engagement_bait", "yes": false, "text": "What would you ask your agents if you could ask all of them at once? That's what the query box is for.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "engagement_bait-130", "q": "engagement_bait", "yes": false, "text": "Sign up and send your first trace.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "vague_group-131", "q": "vague_group", "yes": true, "text": "Most teams skip evals.", "rule": "narrator/vague-majority", "mode": "post", "orig": true}
{"id": "vague_group-132", "q": "vague_group", "yes": true, "text": "The majority of teams skip evals.", "rule": "narrator/vague-majority", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "vague_group-133", "q": "vague_group", "yes": true, "text": "Almost every team skips evals at first.", "rule": "narrator/vague-majority", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "vague_group-134", "q": "vague_group", "yes": true, "text": "Teams skip evals, as everyone knows.", "rule": "narrator/vague-majority", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "vague_group-135", "q": "vague_group", "yes": true, "text": "Many companies already do this.", "rule": "narrator/vague-attribution", "mode": "post", "orig": true}
{"id": "vague_group-136", "q": "vague_group", "yes": true, "text": "Plenty of companies already work this way.", "rule": "narrator/vague-attribution", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "vague_group-137", "q": "vague_group", "yes": true, "text": "Lots of people already do this.", "rule": "narrator/vague-attribution", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "vague_group-138", "q": "vague_group", "yes": true, "text": "Countless engineers have told us the same thing.", "rule": "narrator/vague-attribution", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "vague_group-139", "q": "vague_group", "yes": false, "text": "Of the 40 teams we asked, 31 had no evals.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "vague_group-140", "q": "vague_group", "yes": false, "text": "The most common failure is a timeout.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "vague_group-141", "q": "vague_group", "yes": false, "text": "Two of our customers already do this.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "vague_group-142", "q": "vague_group", "yes": false, "text": "It retries at most twice.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "vague_group-143", "q": "vague_group", "yes": false, "text": "Every project gets one free key.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "vague_group-144", "q": "vague_group", "yes": false, "text": "Our support team reads every handoff.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "personified_abstraction-145", "q": "personified_abstraction", "yes": true, "text": "Who does your AI spend answer to?", "rule": "narrator/personified-abstraction", "mode": "post", "orig": true}
{"id": "personified_abstraction-146", "q": "personified_abstraction", "yes": true, "text": "Your AI spend answers to nobody.", "rule": "narrator/personified-abstraction", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "personified_abstraction-147", "q": "personified_abstraction", "yes": true, "text": "The budget quietly decides who gets to experiment.", "rule": "narrator/personified-abstraction", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "personified_abstraction-148", "q": "personified_abstraction", "yes": true, "text": "Your token bill is telling you a story.", "rule": "narrator/personified-abstraction", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "personified_abstraction-149", "q": "personified_abstraction", "yes": true, "text": "The trace names the layer that broke it.", "rule": "docs/artifact-verb", "mode": "docs", "orig": true}
{"id": "personified_abstraction-150", "q": "personified_abstraction", "yes": true, "text": "The trace knows which layer broke.", "rule": "docs/artifact-verb", "mode": "docs", "orig": false}
{"id": "personified_abstraction-151", "q": "personified_abstraction", "yes": true, "text": "Each span remembers what the tool returned.", "rule": "docs/artifact-verb", "mode": "docs", "orig": false}
{"id": "personified_abstraction-152", "q": "personified_abstraction", "yes": false, "text": "No one on the team owns the AI spend.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "personified_abstraction-153", "q": "personified_abstraction", "yes": false, "text": "The trace shows which layer failed.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "personified_abstraction-154", "q": "personified_abstraction", "yes": false, "text": "Each span records what the tool returned.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "personified_abstraction-155", "q": "personified_abstraction", "yes": false, "text": "The budget caps spend at 100 USD a month.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "personified_abstraction-156", "q": "personified_abstraction", "yes": false, "text": "The agent decides which tool to call.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "personified_abstraction-157", "q": "personified_abstraction", "yes": false, "text": "The judge reads every paragraph.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "training_tense-158", "q": "training_tense", "yes": true, "text": "Another issue is that AI is trained to concede.", "rule": "narrator/training-tense", "mode": "post", "orig": true}
{"id": "training_tense-159", "q": "training_tense", "yes": true, "text": "RLHF teaches models to hedge.", "rule": "narrator/training-tense", "mode": "post", "orig": true}
{"id": "training_tense-160", "q": "training_tense", "yes": true, "text": "Models get rewarded for hedging during training.", "rule": "narrator/training-tense", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "training_tense-161", "q": "training_tense", "yes": true, "text": "Training keeps pushing the model toward safe answers.", "rule": "narrator/training-tense", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "training_tense-162", "q": "training_tense", "yes": true, "text": "Reinforcement learning is teaching these models to agree with you.", "rule": "narrator/training-tense", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "training_tense-163", "q": "training_tense", "yes": true, "text": "The model learns to concede because human raters reward it.", "rule": "narrator/training-tense", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "training_tense-164", "q": "training_tense", "yes": false, "text": "Another issue is that AI was trained to concede.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "training_tense-165", "q": "training_tense", "yes": false, "text": "The model predicts the next word.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "training_tense-166", "q": "training_tense", "yes": false, "text": "Training rewarded the model for passing tests.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "training_tense-167", "q": "training_tense", "yes": false, "text": "We train a small classifier on our own labels every week.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "training_tense-168", "q": "training_tense", "yes": false, "text": "The model hedges when you ask it for an opinion.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "training_tense-169", "q": "training_tense", "yes": false, "text": "During training, raters preferred balanced answers.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "concession-170", "q": "concession", "yes": true, "text": "Sandboxes are great, but your team needs more.", "rule": "pitch/concession", "mode": "ads", "orig": true}
{"id": "concession-171", "q": "concession", "yes": true, "text": "Sure, a sandbox runs your agent. Your team needs more than that.", "rule": "pitch/concession", "mode": "ads", "orig": false}
{"id": "concession-172", "q": "concession", "yes": true, "text": "Sandboxes have their place; your team needs more.", "rule": "pitch/concession", "mode": "ads", "orig": false}
{"id": "concession-173", "q": "concession", "yes": true, "text": "A sandbox is a fine start, though your team will outgrow it.", "rule": "pitch/concession", "mode": "ads", "orig": false}
{"id": "concession-174", "q": "concession", "yes": true, "text": "There's nothing wrong with a sandbox, but it won't onboard your team.", "rule": "pitch/concession", "mode": "ads", "orig": false}
{"id": "concession-175", "q": "concession", "yes": false, "text": "Your team needs more than a sandbox: a place to talk to the agent.", "rule": null, "mode": "ads", "orig": false}
{"id": "concession-176", "q": "concession", "yes": false, "text": "Your agent keeps working when your laptop is shut.", "rule": null, "mode": "ads", "orig": false}
{"id": "concession-177", "q": "concession", "yes": false, "text": "Laze runs your agent on its own computer, ready for the whole team in minutes.", "rule": null, "mode": "ads", "orig": false}
{"id": "concession-178", "q": "concession", "yes": false, "text": "You don't need an agent sandbox.", "rule": null, "mode": "ads", "orig": false}
{"id": "concession-179", "q": "concession", "yes": false, "text": "Self-hosted works in your own cloud, airgapped.", "rule": null, "mode": "ads", "orig": false}
{"id": "concession-180", "q": "concession", "yes": false, "text": "The free plan covers two people.", "rule": null, "mode": "ads", "orig": false}
{"id": "clipped_condition-181", "q": "clipped_condition", "yes": true, "text": "Give the model your notes and it writes about the ticket names.", "rule": "structure/clipped-condition", "mode": "script", "orig": true}
{"id": "clipped_condition-182", "q": "clipped_condition", "yes": true, "text": "Hand the model your notes and out comes a reply about ticket names.", "rule": "structure/clipped-condition", "mode": "script", "orig": false}
{"id": "clipped_condition-183", "q": "clipped_condition", "yes": true, "text": "Paste the notes in, and it writes about ticket names.", "rule": "structure/clipped-condition", "mode": "script", "orig": false}
{"id": "clipped_condition-184", "q": "clipped_condition", "yes": true, "text": "Feed it a PDF, and the reader skims the first page.", "rule": "structure/clipped-condition", "mode": "script", "orig": false}
{"id": "clipped_condition-185", "q": "clipped_condition", "yes": true, "text": "Ask it for a headline, and the headline comes out weak.", "rule": "structure/clipped-condition", "mode": "script", "orig": false}
{"id": "clipped_condition-186", "q": "clipped_condition", "yes": false, "text": "If you give the model your notes, it will write about the ticket names.", "rule": null, "mode": "script", "orig": false}
{"id": "clipped_condition-187", "q": "clipped_condition", "yes": false, "text": "When I gave it my notes, it wrote about the ticket names.", "rule": null, "mode": "script", "orig": false}
{"id": "clipped_condition-188", "q": "clipped_condition", "yes": false, "text": "If you ask it for a headline, it usually comes out weak.", "rule": null, "mode": "script", "orig": false}
{"id": "clipped_condition-189", "q": "clipped_condition", "yes": false, "text": "Give the model your notes. Then read what it wrote.", "rule": null, "mode": "script", "orig": false}
{"id": "clipped_condition-190", "q": "clipped_condition", "yes": false, "text": "You can paste the notes in and see what happens.", "rule": null, "mode": "script", "orig": false}
{"id": "clipped_condition-191", "q": "clipped_condition", "yes": false, "text": "The model writes about the ticket names because that's what the notes are full of.", "rule": null, "mode": "script", "orig": false}
{"id": "staccato-192", "q": "staccato", "yes": true, "text": "Sam gave up on it first. Overhead was high. Handoffs failed silently.", "rule": "structure/staccato", "mode": "post", "orig": true}
{"id": "staccato-193", "q": "staccato", "yes": true, "text": "It works. It scales. It ships.", "rule": "structure/staccato", "mode": "post", "orig": true}
{"id": "staccato-194", "q": "staccato", "yes": true, "text": "The build broke. Nobody noticed. Users did.", "rule": "structure/staccato", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "staccato-195", "q": "staccato", "yes": true, "text": "It worked, it scaled, it shipped.", "rule": "structure/staccato", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "staccato-196", "q": "staccato", "yes": true, "text": "Fast. Cheap. Done.", "rule": "structure/staccato", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "staccato-197", "q": "staccato", "yes": false, "text": "Sam gave up on it first, because the overhead was high and handoffs failed without telling anyone.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "staccato-198", "q": "staccato", "yes": false, "text": "We deployed at 9. At 10 the alerts fired. By 11 we had rolled back.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "staccato-199", "q": "staccato", "yes": false, "text": "It works on Python and TypeScript, and the Go SDK lands next month.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "staccato-200", "q": "staccato", "yes": false, "text": "The run failed. We fixed the timeout and ran it again, and it passed.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "staccato-201", "q": "staccato", "yes": false, "text": "Install it, add the key and send a trace.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "staccato-202", "q": "staccato", "yes": false, "text": "The agent answered in under a second, which surprised us.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "stating_priors-203", "q": "stating_priors", "yes": true, "text": "I went in expecting the cache to win.", "rule": "narrator/stating-priors", "mode": "post", "orig": true}
{"id": "stating_priors-204", "q": "stating_priors", "yes": true, "text": "Going in, I was sure the cache would win.", "rule": "narrator/stating-priors", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "stating_priors-205", "q": "stating_priors", "yes": true, "text": "My bet before the test was on the cache.", "rule": "narrator/stating-priors", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "stating_priors-206", "q": "stating_priors", "yes": true, "text": "I'd assumed the cache would come out on top.", "rule": "narrator/stating-priors", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "stating_priors-207", "q": "stating_priors", "yes": false, "text": "The cache lost: it saved 2% and cost a day of work.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "stating_priors-208", "q": "stating_priors", "yes": false, "text": "We tested the cache against a smaller model.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "stating_priors-209", "q": "stating_priors", "yes": false, "text": "If the cache wins, the bill drops by a third.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "stating_priors-210", "q": "stating_priors", "yes": false, "text": "The cache won on short prompts and lost on long ones.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "stating_priors-211", "q": "stating_priors", "yes": false, "text": "I expected the build to take five minutes and it took four.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "stating_priors-212", "q": "stating_priors", "yes": false, "text": "We picked the cache because it needed no new model.", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "orig": false}
{"id": "slogan_equation-213", "q": "slogan_equation", "yes": true, "text": "The audience is the spec.", "rule": "slogan/x-is-the-y", "mode": "post", "orig": true}
{"id": "slogan_equation-214", "q": "slogan_equation", "yes": true, "text": "Your audience becomes the spec.", "rule": "slogan/x-is-the-y", "mode": "post", "orig": false}
